{"schemaVersion":1,"storyId":"rhyme-seeds-in-the-pits-oware","version":1,"title":"Seeds in the Pits (an oware-style counting rhyme)","ageTiers":["5-6","7-8","9-10"],"language":"en","narrationLocale":"en-GH","pages":[{"n":1,"text":"We set the pits in two long rows,\nwith seeds to count as the game goes.","sentences":["We set the pits in two long rows,\nwith seeds to count as the game goes."],"alt":"A wooden board with two rows of pits and seeds.","image":{"hash":"sha256:2932a74137ef00ba15359e52dfe6933956a8d49526a8c675d4265c6fe43eb1a3","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:733a38119071c30c996d1c57cf1c389fa7c9b333989ed6fa75ade746753f603e","durationMs":6320,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,6320]],"words":[[0,194],[194,486],[486,778],[778,1167],[1167,1361],[1361,1653],[1653,2042],[2042,2917],[2917,3306],[3306,3792],[3792,3986],[3986,4472],[4472,4666],[4666,4958],[4958,5347],[5347,6320]]}}},{"n":2,"text":"Take the seeds from one small pit.\nDrop one in each, and count bit by bit.","sentences":["Take the seeds from one small pit.","Drop one in each, and count bit by bit."],"alt":"A child dropping one seed at a time into pits.","image":{"hash":"sha256:cdea2061731e1799f987b8dd58c39816d8931cad760603233cdc2611f2efeecb","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:fc6372c94c6860b707fae46a5ce43ea399631fc8fe20cf68a4d7a9db198ab30c","durationMs":7640,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3723],[3723,7640]],"words":[[0,392],[392,686],[686,1176],[1176,1568],[1568,1862],[1862,2352],[2352,3723],[3723,4115],[4115,4409],[4409,4605],[4605,5487],[5487,5781],[5781,6271],[6271,6565],[6565,6761],[6761,7640]]}}},{"n":3,"text":"Think, think, think before you play:\nwhich pit will help you win today?","sentences":["Think, think, think before you play:\nwhich pit will help you win today?"],"alt":"Two children thinking over the board.","image":{"hash":"sha256:71dd946e20685bf95badb1b432